{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1531092-ex3-solar-revamp-total-rewrite-of-all-25-abilities-for-solars","id":1531092,"title":"Ex3 Solar Revamp - Total rewrite of all 25 abilities for Solars!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-02-18T22:46:53-08:00","id":1531092,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon1.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Ex3 Solar Revamp - Total rewrite of all 25 abilities for Solars!","content":"<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Do you want to play as Solars but find the current charm system too cumbersome? Are you wanting to run a game but find yourself running face-first into a wall with awkward mechanics? My name is Sandact6 and I may have just the thing for you\u2014my shiny little Solar Revamp Project.</span></span><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">A total and thorough rewrite of Ex3 Solars that allows Solars to shine like the golden god-kings they are without needing to worry about game-shattering highs and soul-draining lows.</span></span></li> <li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Detailed expansions and explanations of most abilities, clarifying many common questions about abilities that apply to all splats!</span></span></li> <li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Hundreds of new charms that add new life and enjoyment into playing Solars.</span></span></li> <li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Over 9 different subsystems that dramatically alter how new abilities are handled but remain compatible with other splats.</span></span></li> <li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Use in whole or in part! Abilities are designed to be as isolated as possible. If you have real issues with one ability for the Solar charmset but want to use the rest of the Solar charmset as in, then you can do that.</span></span></li> <li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Not just Solars! Several abilities contain \u201cUniversal\u201d charmsets, which are documents that allow a charmset to work with all published characters! </span></span></li> <li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Compatibility with Solars that function in Modern or Sci-fi settings.</span></span></li> <li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Hundreds of spelling and grammatical errors</span></span></li> </ul><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">All of this and more can be found in the link below! I always love feedback, so let me know what you think!</span></span><br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1AbL1YEfD-rDrD84nMea_sI3auL7IQBvH67GRovHWyV8/edit\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1AbL1YEfD-rDrD84nMea_sI3auL7IQBvH67GRovHWyV8/edit\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1AbL1YEfD-rDrD84nMea_sI3auL7IQBvH67GRovHWyV8/edit\" target=\"_blank\"> https://docs.google.com/document/d/1AbL1YEfD-rDrD84nMea_sI3auL7IQBvH67GRovHWyV8/edit </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Read my shit at my <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/271207-sandact6-homebrew-topic\" target=\"_blank\">homebrew</a> topic, 2.5e and 3e material!<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1263020-alchemicals-2-0-3e-conversion-charm-design-request\" target=\"_blank\">Play Alchemical's in 3e now</a>, you're welcome.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\u2615","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1183-sandact6","name":"Sandact6","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1183_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-19T04:37:06-08:00","id":1531102,"title":"","content":"Fuck yeah! Thank you!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude0e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-29T19:03:47-08:00","id":1531763,"title":"","content":"First of all. THANK YOU!<br /> <br /> Much appreciated.<br /> <br /> Lots of things to go over and give a try.<br /> <br /> I am definitely going to give Bureaucracy, Occult, Presence and War a try. Those three and Sail are arguably the weakest trees I think.<br /> <br /> I'll be upfront I am not sold on Venture System (have not had a chance to really use it) but I need a Bureaucracy system and if it pans out might try others.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4678-tryingtobeslim","name":"TryingToBeSlim","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-03T12:10:54-08:00","id":1531912,"title":"","content":"Thanks! Glad you like it!<br /> <br /> I mean I did make another system involve mass governance in <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1cJK67vmr7VDQPmisai8KqkXZI2qOeFas78jWrsMoeFU/edit\" target=\"_blank\">Creation's Overlords</a>. The problem was that in playtesting it was too game-y. When ventures were released and I noticed that I could not only use them organization management, in a package that was simpler to understand, and worked almost everything else? I wouldn't say it was a no brainer as it had me considering options, but I threw all my eggs into the basket after some thought.<br /> <br /> In fact I think you can even replicate this somewhat in standard ventures. Just have your army or other military advantages you have as various obstacles and then add in a list of target that you possess that an enemy would consider valuable (Key strategic locations, secrets, and whatnot). Have this exceed the standard limit for obstacles, then have the ST do the same for the opponent. When the venture begins you then have X turns to break as many of the opponent's obstacles as possible, and once the terminus is up both sides need to take a break to recoup.<br /> <br /> But as I said, the rework is modular in nature. If you don't like the bureaucracy system it's easily subbed out for something else.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Read my shit at my <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/271207-sandact6-homebrew-topic\" target=\"_blank\">homebrew</a> topic, 2.5e and 3e material!<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1263020-alchemicals-2-0-3e-conversion-charm-design-request\" target=\"_blank\">Play Alchemical's in 3e now</a>, you're welcome.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/